{"reviews":[{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-0","r":5.0,"t":"perfect","x":"I use this to clean my bath tubs and it works perfectly! I soak the cotton coil with bleach then put it around my bath tub and even around my window sill. I usually left it overnight and it works like a charm! All mildew and molds are gone!","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-1","r":1.0,"t":"poor quality","x":"I ordered 2 boxes - was surprised to see how small they were, out of curiosity, I measured them, one was 33 feet and one 35 , so right there a total of 8 feet short. I didn't bother measuring the second box as the cotton separates and leaves dust all over everything. As I purchased this for a nails, this is of no use as is. I will find a use for it at some point, but it will have to be with something that leaving shredded cotton all over wont matter. I cant believe the amount of fiber dust!  Wil","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-2","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for bleaching grout!","x":"I buy this to use for bleaching grout in the shower!  I saw this tip on Pinterest.  You carefully and in a well ventilated area - soak the cotton in the bleach and then apply it to grout, letting it sit for a bit.  When you remove the cotton coil, your grout is white.  Worked great and this cotton coil is a nice quality and price!","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product","x":"100% cotton that comes in one continuous roll makes for much easier spun cotton crafting!!  I highly recommend this product and its seller!!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-4","r":5.0,"t":"He said it was perfect! It's in my cart so I can order ...","x":"I bought this for my dad-- he requested this so he could soak it in bleach and clean his grout. He said it was perfect! It's in my cart so I can order some for myself!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-5","r":5.0,"t":"I like that for perms and anything that needs cotton","x":"This is a thicker coil than one would buy in the beauty supply. I like that for perms and anything that needs cotton, including removing nail polish.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-6","r":1.0,"t":"DO NOT USE FOR VAPORIZERS","x":"DO NOT USE THIS FOR VAPORIZERS. It is organic cotton but the taste is terrible, the break in takes forever and the it falls apart as your wicking","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-7","r":5.0,"t":"works great!!","x":"using this to clean my tub and surround. Soak in bleach and let sit for hours, works great!!!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-8","r":5.0,"t":"LIKE","x":"Good stuff to infuse with bleach and lay on your shower chaulk to clean mildew and mold!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-9","r":5.0,"t":"Fantastic Quality, length was more then advertised by a foot and no residue","x":"I use cotton coils for packing pet med bottles so the capsules dont rattle during shipping and my supply ran out,  I was reading the reviews and noticed one that undersized and slammed the seller.  Not sure if it was a tactical review.  Delivered to my business same day, opened up the box and each coil is wrapped in a bag and was easy to use.  I laid out the coils to see for myself if they were undersized, nope over by almost a foot on each.  Buying Cotton coils they shrink and its sold by weigh","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-10","r":5.0,"t":"Very useful","x":"I bought this product in order to bleach my roots. My roots had grown out more than a quarter inch and I decided to bleach my hair myself. I watched a couple of YouTube videos and saw that cotton coil is helpful in separating hair after in has bleach in it. I'm not a hair stylist but I did follow hair stylists tips in order to keep my hair from falling out.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-11","r":5.0,"t":"Face value on this one","x":"It was cotton. Came coiled. Didn't measure, but if I had to guess I'd say this was about 40 feet long. Pretty happy here.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-12","r":1.0,"t":"I received 2 TINY bags of cotton NO WAY IS IT 40 FEET EACH????","x":"It reads 40 FEET X 2 BAGS!  I received TWO VERY VERY VERY TINY BAGS OF COTTON!!!!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-13","r":5.0,"t":"Quality cotton","x":"Great cotton. Tip: don't open the box. Cut a hole in the sealed box just big enough for your thumb and forfinger to reach in. This way, it despences sort of like a Kleenex box.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-14","r":1.0,"t":"Not what you ordered","x":"So upset! This order was 2 boxes of 40 ft, making it 80 ft total. I only got one box of 40 ft. False advertising..what a rip off!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-15","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent quality.","x":"Nice heavy cotton that really stops the drips.  Very happy with this product.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-16","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"using to seal windows so stink bugs don't get through the cracks","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-17","r":1.0,"t":"No corresponde con la cantidad que dicen","x":"Est\u00e1 foto no corresponde con el producto No creo que el art\u00edculo que me enviaron tenga la cantidad que dicen me enviaron 2 paqueticos de algod\u00f3n pequenitos","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-18","r":1.0,"t":"No corresponde con la cantidad que dicen","x":"Est\u00e1 foto no corresponde con el producto No creo que el art\u00edculo que me enviaron tenga la cantidad que dicen me enviaron 2 paqueticos de algod\u00f3n pequenitos","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-19","r":5.0,"t":"use it to put the cleaner on it and tuck ...","x":"use it to put the cleaner on it and tuck it into the cracks of the area needing to be cleaned. works great","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-20","r":5.0,"t":"Quantity and price product is great!","x":"Works great used for my shower with Clorox to clean up hard water stains over night my wife was amazed!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-21","r":5.0,"t":"Christmas Village","x":"This product is being used for a Christmas village display and is perfect for snow around the pond.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-22","r":1.0,"t":"too expensive, poor quality","x":"you can get better quality and 3 times more of the product for the price somewhere else!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-23","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"The cotton coil was perfect in helping me clean around the bathtub. Thank you.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01GVR17ZC-24","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality cotton coil","x":"Nice thick coil - arrived quickly...all in all I'd buy again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the cotton coil highly effective for cleaning tasks like bleaching grout, tubs, and mildew when soaked in bleach.","cites":[1,3,5,8,9]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the quality and usefulness of the cotton for various purposes including perms, nail polish removal, and crafting.","cites":[4,6,10,11,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers report receiving less product than advertised, with boxes being short in length or missing entirely.","cites":[2,13,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain about the cotton separating and leaving dust or residue.","cites":[2,7]},{"text":"One reviewer warns against using the product for vaporizers due to poor taste and it falling apart.","cites":[7]}]},"qa":[]}